      <h1 class="jr-h1">Does Collagen Help Cellulite? What Two Trials Actually Found</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Search this question and almost every answer on the first screen is written by someone selling collagen. Here are the only two randomised trials that have measured cellulite, what each one actually tested, and the treatments with better numbers behind them.</p>

